# el++ engine fixture 22 (src/test.slop: ksc-fixture-at, test-ksc-entailments).
# 22. K7: Self on a sub-role through (2) and (14), feeding a range and a chain.
# r1(a, a), r1 ⊑ r, range(r) = D, ∃r.Self ⊑ F, s(a, b), B(b), r ∘ s ⊑ t,
# ∃t.B ⊑ E, Q ⊑ {a} ⊨ Q ⊑ D, F, E.
# Inside el++ whole: the engine must answer every class as the literal Psc
# reference does (test-ksc-engine-matches-reference).

@prefix : <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty . :s a owl:ObjectProperty . :t a owl:ObjectProperty .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:r1 a owl:ObjectProperty . :B a owl:Class . :Q a owl:Class . :E a owl:Class . :F a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:r1 rdfs:subPropertyOf :r .
:r rdfs:range :D .
:a :r1 :a .
:a :s :b .
:b a :B .
:t owl:propertyChainAxiom ( :r :s ) .
:Q rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:oneOf ( :a ) ] .
[ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:hasSelf true ] rdfs:subClassOf :F .
[ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :t ; owl:someValuesFrom :B ] rdfs:subClassOf :E .
